# ============================================================================
# JX3 linux-build — git tracks SOURCE ONLY (the fixed 2.5.2 port).
# Everything below is a build INPUT (fetched), an OUTPUT (generated), or
# leaked MSVC cruft that bloats src/ from a few MB to 357M.
# NOTE: gitignore has NO inline comments — every pattern on its own line.
# ============================================================================

# --- build outputs / generated at build time ---
obj/
shim/
Source/
/SO3GameServer
_build.log

# --- binary build INPUTS (reused engine .so, copied from 镜像端 by setup.sh) ---
libs/*.so

# --- reverse-engineering / analysis artifacts (large, machine-local) ---
ghidra-project/
logs/
_other/
_packPAK_recovered/

# --- leaked Visual Studio build cruft inside src/ (NOT source; bloats to 357M) ---
*.sdf
*.ncb
*.pch
*.pdb
*.idb
*.ipch
*.obj
*.tlog
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.aps
*.res
*.user
*.cod
*.vsd
ipch/
.vs/
Debug/
Debug_Server/
Debug_Client/
Release/
Release_Server/
Release_Client/

